@startuml
participant "Rose Entry" as Entry
participant "Teal Core" as Core
participant "Gold Exit" as Exit
== divider before width competition ==
group width rotation frame
  Entry -> Core ++ : establish active centre
  note left of Core : a long folded note owns the left side of the envelope
  Core -->] : a longer outbound boundary owns the right side of the envelope
  Core -> Exit : participant-span member
  deactivate Core
end
== divider after width competition ==
[-> Entry : late left boundary control
Exit --> Entry : final internal control
@enduml
